      "name": "Drain Life",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When a tzitzimitl's claw Strike deals damage to a living creature, the tzitzimitl gains 20 temporary Hit Points, and the target must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save save or become Drained 2. Further damage dealt by a tzitzimitl's claw Strike increases the value of the drained condition by 2 on a failed save, to a maximum of Drained 4.\n\nEffect: Drain Life",
